<title>JAPAN: Sonocom - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sonocom - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.79		vs	    1.59</p>
<p> Operating	  226 million	 vs	  304 million</p>
<p> Current	    231 million	 vs	  306 million</p>
<p> Net		  125 million	 vs	  167 million</p>
<p> EPS		   24.78 yen	  vs	   33.09 yen</p>
<p> Shares		5 million	  vs	   5 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sonocom Co Ltd is a manufacturer of screen printing plates.</p>
